msgid ""
"(allow a few minutes, then reload the page). The result will open in the "
"\"Gen\" tab."
msgstr ""
":\n"
"                        comptez quelques minutes, puis rechargez la page. Le résultat\n"
"                        s'ouvrira dans l'onglet « Gen »."

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial_genfox.view_editorial_entry_form_genfox
msgid "<b>Gen is working on this article.</b> Started on"
msgstr ""
"<b>Gen travaille sur cet article.</b>\n"
"                        Lancé le"

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial_genfox.view_editorial_suggestion_form
msgid ""
"<b>Stalled run.</b> It never reported a status: the bridge was probably "
"restarted, or the time limit passed. Nothing was written to the article. Run"
" it again from the entry."
msgstr ""
"<b>Passe sans nouvelle.</b>\n"
"                        Elle n'a jamais rendu de statut : le pont a probablement été\n"
"                        redémarré, ou le plafond de temps est passé. Rien n'a été écrit\n"
"                        dans l'article. Relancez la passe depuis l'entrée."

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial_genfox.view_editorial_entry_form_genfox
msgid "<b>Stalled run.</b> The run started on"
msgstr ""
"<b>Passe sans nouvelle.</b>\n"
"                    Celle lancée le"

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial_genfox.view_editorial_entry_form_genfox
msgid "<i class=\"fa fa-circle-o-notch fa-spin me-2\" title=\"In progress\"/>"
msgstr "<i class=\"fa fa-circle-o-notch fa-spin me-2\" title=\"En cours\"/>"

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial_genfox.view_editorial_suggestion_form
msgid ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-circle-o-notch fa-spin me-2\" title=\"In progress\"/> "
"<span> <b>Gen is working.</b> This record will fill in by itself: allow a "
"few minutes, then reload the page. </span>"
msgstr ""
"<i class=\"fa fa-circle-o-notch fa-spin me-2\" title=\"En cours\"/>\n"
"                        <span>\n"
"                            <b>Gen travaille.</b>\n"
"                            Cette fiche se remplira toute seule : comptez quelques\n"
"                            minutes, puis rechargez la page.\n"
"                        </span>"

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_editorial_genfox/models/suggestion.py:0
msgid ""
"<p>Gen suggestion applied by %s. Slots written: %s.</p><p>The editorial QA "
"must be run again. %s</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Proposition Gen appliquée par %s. Créneaux écrits : %s.</p><p>La QA "
"éditoriale est à repasser. %s</p>"

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_genfox.field_bf_editorial_entry__genfox_pending_decision
msgid ""
"A delivered suggestion carries text that nobody has applied or discarded "
"yet. Turns the \"Gen suggestions\" button blue: there is a decision to make,"
" not just something to read."
msgstr ""
"Une proposition rendue porte un texte que personne n'a encore appliqué ni "
"écarté. Fait passer le bouton « Propositions Gen » en bleu : il y a une "
"décision à prendre, pas seulement une lecture."

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_genfox.field_bf_editorial_suggestion__pending_decision
msgid ""
"A delivered suggestion that carries text and that nobody has applied or "
"discarded yet. Discarding deletes it, so this field only has to check "
"\"delivered, has text, not applied\"."
msgstr ""
"Une proposition rendue, qui porte un texte, et que personne n'a encore "
"appliquée ni écartée. Écarter la supprime : ce champ n'a donc qu'à vérifier "
"« rendue, porte un texte, pas appliquée »."

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_genfox.field_bf_editorial_entry__genfox_stalled
msgid ""
"A run that was started never came back. The buttons are available again: "
"better to be able to run it again than to stay stuck."
msgstr ""
"Une passe lancée n'est jamais revenue. Les boutons redeviennent disponibles "
": mieux vaut pouvoir relancer que rester bloqué."

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_editorial_genfox.view_editorial_entry_form_genfox
msgid ""
"A single run: what regular expressions cannot reach (repetitions, link text,"
" drift from the declared angle, house style) and an expanded text if the "
"entry needs one. Nothing is written to the article on its own."
msgstr ""
"Une seule passe : ce que les expressions régulières n'atteignent pas — "
"répétitions, texte des liens, dérive par rapport à l'angle déclaré, style "
"maison — et un texte étoffé si l'entrée en a besoin. Rien n'est écrit dans "
"l'article de lui-même."

