msgid ""
"Gen suggests, you apply. A suggestion only enters the article through the "
"\"Apply to the post\" button, and it refuses if the article has changed "
"since it was computed."
msgstr ""
"Gen propose, vous appliquez. Une proposition n'entre\n"
"                        dans l'article que par le bouton « Appliquer au billet »,\n"
"                        et elle refuse si l'article a bougé depuis son calcul."

#. module: bf_editorial_genfox
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_editorial_genfox/models/suggestion.py:0
